    {
      "case_id": "batch5_wrong_pool_category",
      "description": "Adjustable-rate pool: the condition's own equality predicate (p1) already requires the fixed-rate, single-lender pool category, so this fails on the condition itself (no_match) on both sides regardless of the balance or the threshold edit -- the rule's separately-declared exceptions for other pool categories are, by construction, unreachable here.",
